<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-GIO in Indian funds, broking venture.</title>
<headline>RTRS-GIO in Indian funds, broking venture.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurance group GIO Australia Holdings Ltd said on Monday it had formed a joint venture with Indian industrial group Chemplast Sanmar Ltd to set up a funds management, fixed interest broking and bond trading operation in Madras.</p>
<p>GIO said under the agreement, two new companies will be set up and equally owned by GIO Australia and Sanmar. The joint venture had been approved by India's Foreign Investment Permission Board.</p>
</text>
